      "content": "that's a good start. i like the tension between the partners. i want to lean into that \"realism\" more though. when you're thinking about the criminal archetypes, can you go a bit deeper on the specific ethnic or cultural backgrounds for the gang members and the street-level guys? i want to make sure the world feels lived-in and that the different crews feel distinct from each other based on their backgrounds.",
